<title>USA: Camelot wants one-for-20 reverse split.</title>
<headline>Camelot wants one-for-20 reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Camelot Corp said Wednesday that it will be holding a special meeting of its shareholders in order to seek authorization to undertake a one-for-20 reverse stock split.</p>
<p>The company said the change would satisfy Nasdaq listing maintenance standards which it expects will become effective shortly.</p>
<p>An announcement providing additional details will be made in due course, said the company.</p>
</text>
